  "fetchedAt": "2026-01-23T17:53:23.614Z",
  "screenshotPath": "screenshots/2026-01/middleware-io-d24401fb.png",
  "text": "Product\nSolutions\nPricing\nDocs\nLearn\nLog In\nGet Started Free\nTake Charge of Your Data Take Control of Your Costs\n\nFlexible pricing that adapts to your business growth.\n\nFree Forever\n$0\n\nFree access to all features with monthly limits.\n\nSign Up Now\n\nFeatures\n\n10 Errors Solution with OpsAI\nUp to 100GB Data\nUp to 1k RUM Sessions\nUp to 20K Synthetic Checks\n10 Browser Test Runs\nUnlimited Users\nCommunity Based Support\n14 day retention\nPay As You Go\n$0.3 GB of metrics, logs, traces\n\nPay only for what you use, with free tier usage included.\n\nSign Up Now\n\nEverything in Free +\n\n$1 per error solved with OpsAI\n$1 per 1K RUM Sessions\n$1 per 5K Synthetic Checks\n$9.99 per 1K Browser Test Runs\nIngestion Control & Data Pipeline\nDefault 30 day retention\nSSO and Security Features\nDedicated Slack/MS Teams Channel\nEnterprise\nCustom Pricing\n\nEnjoy volume discounts and premium support with our enterprise solutions.\n\nContact Us\n\nEverything in Pay As You Go +\n\nError solving with OpsAI\nOn-Premise Deployment\nDedicated Account Team\nBrowser Test Runs\nMulti-year Contract Discounts\nCustom Data Retention\nBring Your Own Cloud\n24x7 Support\nOpsAI\nRoot Cause Analysis\nFaster Issue Solving\nAutomatic Issue Detection\nAutomatic PR Generation\n$1\nper error solved\nCalculate The Price Based On Your Usage\nLet's Find a Plan that Suits You\n\nEstimated Data Volume\n\nGB\n\nEstimated Real User Monitoring Sessions\n\nEstimated Synthetic Checks\n\nError Solved with OpsAI\n\nEstimated Browser Test Runs\n\nData volume is the sum total of uncompressed logs, metrics, and traces.\n\nCongrats!\n\nConsidering your estimation, Free Forever plan will be a better fit for you.\n\nFree Tier Usage\nData Volume\t100GB\t$0\nRUM Sessions\t1000\t$0\nSynthetic Checks\t20000\t$0\nError Solved with OpsAI\t10\t$0\nBrowser Test Runs\t10\t$0\n\nTotal\n\n$0.00\nLogs\nInfrastructure\nApplication Performance Monitoring\nOpsAI\nSynthetic Testing\nBrowser Testing\nReal User Monitoring\nLive Alerting\nCustom Dashboards\nUser Facing Status Page\nInfrastructure\n\nData\n\nFree up to 100 GB\n\nAdditional\n\n$0.3 per GB Metrics\n\nStandard Metrics\nCustom Metrics\nContainer Monitoring\nService Monitoring\nProcess Monitoring\nKubernetes Monitoring\nCorrelate Traces & Logs\nAWS Monitoring\nPre-Built & Customizable Dashboards\nFive-Second Batch Ingestion\nOnly Ingest What You Need\nMetric-Level Ingestion Controls\nAttribute-based k8s Ingestion Controls\nFAQs\n\nEverything you want to know about Middleware's pricing\n\nIs Middleware Free To Use?\n\nYes, our free tier provides monthly limits to all three services, logs, metrics and traces, which is a great starting point for any team of any size.\n\nAre There Different Pricing Tiers?\n\nMiddleware offers three tiers: free, pay as you go, and custom. Free is a limited amount of usage monthly. Pay-as-you-go is a flat rate for data volume and best to get started. Contracted is for longer term commitments, retention rates and discounts.\n\nHow Is The Data Usage Calculated?\n\nWe measure your data on a daily basis, and per data type and source. For example, a 10GB per day in a 30 day month would be 300GB for the month. Note that this is based on the amount of data actually stored on Middleware, not necessarily everything that's sent to the platform. Meaning you will not be charged for data that you decide to drop by using Middleware's data pipeline.\n\nDo You Have Discounts For Startups And Nonprofits?\n\nWe do! Contact us to learn more about discount options.\n\nIs Middleware Just A Wrapper For Otel?\n\nWe leverage Otel as a framework for our agents because there is no point in creating another blackbox collector. That being said, we have built many components in our stack that handle the streaming, compression, storage, and querying, and of course a UI that brings it all together. We also support many other data collectors and origins like Prometheus, databases, etc. and are not restricted to type of data.\n\nWhat Are Your Data Retention Options?\n\nOur free tier is 14 days, pay-as-you-go is 30, and custom contracts have custom retention rates. Contact us to learn more.\n\nWhat About Data Security?\n\nMiddleware works tirelessly to ensure the protection of customer data and is committed to continuous improvements to our information security management practices. We aim to ensure the appropriate confidentiality, privacy, integrity, and availability practices are maintained in accordance with the requirements of data security standards as outlined by the SOC2 Trust Service Principles. We ensure that its security commitments are well documented and illustrated to user entities through our website, contract agreement, or in a service level agreement. Read more about our security policies here.\n\nCan I Cancel My Account?\n\nYes, you can cancel anytime with the pay-as-you-go option. We keep your data for 30 days from the cancellation date so you can download them.\n\nHow Much Does OpsAI Cost?\n\nError detection is completely free so that you can view all detected issues at no extra cost. To find the root cause or get solution it's just $1 per error. PR generation is included along with root cause analysis and solution at no extra cost.\n\nOptimize More, Worry Less With Middleware\nGet Started\nBook a Demo\nProduct\nInfrastructure Monitoring\nLog Monitoring\nAPM\nMetrics\nDistributed Tracing\nDatabase Monitoring\nReal User Monitoring\nSynthetic Monitoring\nContainer Monitoring\nServerless Monitoring\nLLM Observability\nBrowser Testing\nOpsAI Agent\nOur Platform\nOverview\nUnified Experience\nAlerts\nQuery Language\nPipeline\nIntegrations\nSession Replay\nError Tracking\nContinuous Profiler\nQuery Genie\nOur Solution\nTechnology\nAWS\nAzure\nGCP\nComparison\nDatadog Alternative\nNewrelic Alternative\nDynatrace Alternative\nGrafana Alternative\nResources\nCustomers\nCommunity\nEvents\nWhitepapers\nNewsletter\nMedia Coverage\nBlog\nHelp-Docs\nAPI-Docs\nProduct Updates\nPodcasts\nCompany\nAbout Us\nCareers\nPartner\nContact Us\nSecurity\nSecurity\nGDPR\n\n©2026 Middleware, All rights reserved\n\nPrivacy-PolicyTerms & ConditionsCookie-PolicyMaster Subscription Agreement",
