In</a><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"sign-up ahref-btn primary\" aria-label=\"Middleware Register\" href=\"https://app.middleware.io/auth/register/\">Get Started Free</a></div></div></div></div></nav></header><main><div class=\"middle-wrapper site-page  pricing-page\"><div class=\"pricing-page-v2\"><div class=\"pricing-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><h1><span class=\"text-gradient\">Take Charge of Your Data </span> Take Control of Your Costs</h1><p>Flexible pricing that adapts to your business growth.</p><div class=\"pricing-card\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"header-item\"><h4>Free Forever</h4><h2 class=\"text-gradient\"> $0</h2><p>Free access to all features with monthly limits.</p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"ahref-btn primary\" href=\"https://app.middleware.io/auth/register/\">Sign Up Now</a></div><p>Features</p><ul><li class=\"list-after-icon\">10 Errors Solution with OpsAI</li><li>Up to 100GB Data</li><li>Up to 1k RUM Sessions</li><li>Up to 20K Synthetic Checks</li><li>10 Browser Test Runs</li><li>Unlimited Users</li><li>Community Based Support</li><li>14 day retention</li></ul></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"header-item\"><h4>Pay As You Go</h4><h2 class=\"text-gradient\"> $0.3 <span>GB of metrics, logs, traces</span></h2><p>Pay only for what you use, with free tier usage included.</p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"ahref-btn primary\" href=\"https://app.middleware.io/auth/register/\">Sign Up Now</a></div><p>Everything in Free +</p><ul><li class=\"list-after-icon\">$1 per error solved with OpsAI</li><li>$1 per 1K RUM Sessions</li><li>$1 per 5K Synthetic Checks </li><li>$9.99 per 1K Browser Test Runs</li><li>Ingestion Control &amp; Data Pipeline</li><li>Default 30 day retention</li><li>SSO and Security Features</li><li>Dedicated Slack/MS Teams Channel</li></ul></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"header-item\"><h4>Enterprise</h4><h2 class=\"text-gradient\"> Custom Pricing</h2><p>Enjoy volume discounts and premium support with our enterprise solutions.</p><a class=\"ahref-btn primary\" href=\"/contact-us/\">Contact Us</a></div><p>Everything in Pay As You Go +</p><ul><li class=\"list-after-icon\">Error solving with OpsAI</li><li>On-Premise Deployment</li><li>Dedicated Account Team</li><li>Browser Test Runs</li><li>Multi-year Contract Discounts</li><li>Custom Data Retention</li><li>Bring Your Own Cloud</li><li>24x7 Support</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"pricing-pre-deploy\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"d-flex\"><div class=\"premise-deploy\"><h2 class=\"text-gradient\">OpsAI</h2></div><div class=\"premise-list\"><ul><li>Root Cause Analysis</li><li>Faster Issue Solving</li></ul><ul><li>Automatic Issue Detection</li><li>Automatic PR Generation</li></ul></div><div class=\"premise-contact\"><h2>$1 <span>per error solved</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"pricing-calculator\"><div class=\"calculate-label\">Calculate The Price Based On Your Usage</div><div class=\"d-flex\"><div class=\"left-block\"><h4>Let's Find a Plan that Suits You</h4><div class=\"data\"><div class=\"data-flex\"><p>Estimated Data Volume</p><div class=\"input-data gb\"><input type=\"number\" value=\"100\"><div class=\"select-box--box\"><div class=\"select-box--container\"><div class=\"select-box--selected-item\">GB</div><div class=\"select-box--arrow\"><span class=\"select-box--arrow-down\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 13 8\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M6.5 7L12 1\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M6.5 7L1 1\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></div><div style=\"display:none\" class=\"select-box--items\"><div class=\"selected\">GB</div><div class=\"\">TB</div><div class=\"\">PB</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mw-range-slider-container\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"102400\" class=\"range-slider\" style=\"--value:100;--min:0;--max:102400\" value=\"100\"></div></div><div class=\"data\"><div class=\"data-flex\"><p>Estimated Real User Monitoring Sessions</p><div class=\"input-data\"><input type=\"number\" value=\"1000\"></div></div><div class=\"mw-range-slider-container\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"10000000\" class=\"range-slider\" style=\"--value:1000;--min:0;--max:10000000\" value=\"1000\"></div></div><div class=\"data\"><div class=\"data-flex\"><p>Estimated Synthetic Checks</p><div class=\"input-data\"><input type=\"number\" value=\"20000\"></div></div><div class=\"mw-range-slider-container\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"10000000\" class=\"range-slider\" style=\"--value:20000;--min:0;--max:10000000\" value=\"20000\"></div></div><div class=\"data\"><div class=\"data-flex\"><p>Error Solved with OpsAI</p><div class=\"input-data\"><input type=\"number\" value=\"10\"></div></div><div class=\"mw-range-slider-container\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100000\" class=\"range-slider\" style=\"--value:10;--min:0;--max:100000\" value=\"10\"></div></div><div class=\"data\"><div class=\"data-flex\"><p>Estimated Browser Test Runs</p><div class=\"input-data\"><input type=\"number\" value=\"10\"></div></div><div class=\"mw-range-slider-container\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100000\" class=\"range-slider\" style=\"--value:10;--min:0;--max:100000\" value=\"10\"></div></div><p class=\"info\">Data volume is the sum total of uncompressed logs, metrics, and traces.</p></div><div class=\"right-block\"><div class=\"inner-card\"><div class=\"top-heading pd\"><h4 class=\"text-gradient\">Congrats!</h4><p>Considering your estimation,<!-- --> <!-- -->Free Forever<!-- --> plan will be a better fit for you.</p></div><div class=\"free-tier pd\"><div class=\"price-tag with-border\">Free Tier Usage</div><table><tbody><tr><td>Data Volume</td><td>100<!-- -->GB</td><td>$0</td></tr><tr><td>RUM Sessions</td><td>1000</td><td>$0</td></tr><tr><td>Synthetic Checks</td><td>20000</td><td>$0</td></tr><tr><td>Error Solved with OpsAI</td><td>10</td><td>$0</td></tr><tr><td>Browser Test Runs</td><td>10</td><td>$0</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"pricing-card-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"total-price pd\"><p>Total</p><h3 class=\"text-gradient\">$<!-- -->0.00</h3></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class=\"pricing-tabs\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"tab-content\"><div class=\"d-flex\"><div class=\"top-tabs\"><ul><li class=\"\">Logs</li><li class=\"active\">Infrastructure</li><li class=\"\">Application Performance Monitoring</li><li class=\"\">OpsAI</li><li class=\"\">Synthetic Testing</li><li class=\"\">Browser Testing</li><li class=\"\">Real User Monitoring</li><li class=\"\">Live Alerting</li><li class=\"\">Custom Dashboards</li><li class=\"\">User Facing Status Page</li></ul><div class=\"select-box--box\"><div class=\"select-box--container\"><div class=\"select-box--selected-item\">Infrastructure</div><div class=\"select-box--arrow\"><span class=\"select-box--arrow-down\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 13 8\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M6.5 7L12 1\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M6.5 7L1 1\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></div><div style=\"display:none\" class=\"select-box--items\"><div class=\"\">Logs</div><div class=\"selected\">Infrastructure</div><div class=\"\">Application Performance Monitoring</div><div class=\"\">OpsAI</div><div class=\"\">Synthetic Testing</div><div class=\"\">Browser Testing</div><div class=\"\">Real User Monitoring</div><div class=\"\">Live Alerting</div><div class=\"\">Custom Dashboards</div><div class=\"\">User Facing Status Page</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"right-content\"><div class=\"content\" id=\"infrastructure\"><h3><span class=\"text-gradient\">Infrastructure</span></h3><div class=\"price-details\"><div class=\"d-flex\"><p>Data</p><p>Free up to 100 GB</p></div><div class=\"d-flex\"><p>Additional</p><p>$0.3 per GB Metrics</p></div></div><ul class=\"features-list\"><li>Standard Metrics</li><li>Custom Metrics</li><li>Container Monitoring</li><li>Service Monitoring</li><li>Process Monitoring</li><li>Kubernetes Monitoring</li><li>Correlate Traces &amp; Logs</li><li>AWS Monitoring</li><li>Pre-Built &amp; Customizable Dashboards</li><li>Five-Second Batch Ingestion</li><li>Only Ingest What You Need</li><li>Metric-Level Ingestion Controls</li><li>Attribute-based k8s Ingestion Controls</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"faq-section\"><div class=\"container\"><h2>FAQs</h2><p>Everything you want to know about Middleware's pricing</p><div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"accordion\"><div class=\"accordion-group\"><div class=\"accordion-card\"><div class=\"accordion-header\"><div class=\"accordion-toggle \"><h5 class=\"accordion-title\">Is Middleware free to use?</h5><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 7V15M7 11H15M21 11C21 16.5228 16.5228 21 11 21C5.47715 21 1 16.5228 1 11C1 5.47715 5.47715 1 11 1C16.5228 1 21 5.47715 21 11Z\" stroke=\"#5B5FC7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"faq-collapse \"><div class=\"accordion-body\"><p>Yes, our free tier provides monthly limits to all three services, logs, metrics and traces, which is a great starting point for any team of any size.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-card\"><div class=\"accordion-header\"><div class=\"accordion-toggle \"><h5 class=\"accordion-title\">Are there different pricing tiers?</h5><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 7V15M7 11H15M21 11C21 16.5228 16.5228 21 11 21C5.47715 21 1 16.5228 1 11C1 5.47715 5.47715 1 11 1C16.5228 1 21 5.47715 21 11Z\" stroke=\"#5B5FC7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"faq-collapse \"><div class=\"accordion-body\"><p>Middleware offers three tiers: free, pay as you go, and custom. Free is a limited amount of usage monthly. Pay-as-you-go is a flat rate for data volume and best to get started. Contracted is for longer term commitments, retention rates and discounts.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-card\"><div class=\"accordion-header\"><div class=\"accordion-toggle \"><h5 class=\"accordion-title\">How is the data usage calculated?</h5><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 7V15M7 11H15M21 11C21 16.5228 16.5228 21 11 21C5.47715 21 1 16.5228 1 11C1 5.47715 5.47715 1 11 1C16.5228 1 21 5.47715 21 11Z\" stroke=\"#5B5FC7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"faq-collapse \"><div class=\"accordion-body\"><p>We measure your data on a daily basis, and per data type and source. For example, a 10GB per day in a 30 day month would be 300GB for the month. Note that this is based on the amount of data actually stored on Middleware, not necessarily everything that's sent to the platform. Meaning you will not be charged for data that you decide to drop by using Middleware's data pipeline.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-card\"><div class=\"accordion-header\"><div class=\"accordion-toggle \"><h5 class=\"accordion-title\">Do you have discounts for startups and nonprofits?</h5><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 7V15M7 11H15M21 11C21 16.5228 16.5228 21 11 21C5.47715 21 1 16.5228 1 11C1 5.47715 5.47715 1 11 1C16.5228 1 21 5.47715 21 11Z\" stroke=\"#5B5FC7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"faq-collapse \"><div class=\"accordion-body\"><p>We do! <a href=\"/contact-us/\">Contact us</a> to learn more about discount options.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-card\"><div class=\"accordion-header\"><div class=\"accordion-toggle \"><h5 class=\"accordion-title\">Is Middleware just a wrapper for Otel?</h5><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 7V15M7 11H15M21 11C21 16.5228 16.5228 21 11 21C5.47715 21 1 16.5228 1 11C1 5.47715 5.47715 1 11 1C16.5228 1 21 5.47715 21 11Z\" stroke=\"#5B5FC7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"faq-collapse \"><div class=\"accordion-body\"><p>We leverage Otel as a framework for our agents because there is no point in creating another blackbox collector. That being said, we have built many components in our stack that handle the streaming, compression, storage, and querying, and of course a UI that brings it all together. We also support many other data collectors and origins like Prometheus, databases, etc. and are not restricted to type of data.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-card\"><div class=\"accordion-header\"><div class=\"accordion-toggle \"><h5 class=\"accordion-title\">What are your data retention options?</h5><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 7V15M7 11H15M21 11C21 16.5228 16.5228 21 11 21C5.47715 21 1 16.5228 1 11C1 5.47715 5.47715 1 11 1C16.5228 1 21 5.47715 21 11Z\" stroke=\"#5B5FC7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"faq-collapse \"><div class=\"accordion-body\"><p>Our free tier is 14 days, pay-as-you-go is 30, and custom contracts have custom retention rates. <a href=\"/contact-us/\">Contact us</a> to learn more.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-card\"><div class=\"accordion-header\"><div class=\"accordion-toggle \"><h5 class=\"accordion-title\">What about data security?</h5><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 7V15M7 11H15M21 11C21 16.5228 16.5228 21 11 21C5.47715 21 1 16.5228 1 11C1 5.47715 5.47715 1 11 1C16.5228 1 21 5.47715 21 11Z\" stroke=\"#5B5FC7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"faq-collapse \"><div class=\"accordion-body\"><p>Middleware works tirelessly to ensure the protection of customer data and is committed to continuous improvements to our information security management practices. We aim to ensure the appropriate confidentiality, privacy, integrity, and availability practices are maintained in accordance with the requirements of data security standards as outlined by the SOC2 Trust Service Principles. We ensure that its security commitments are well documented and illustrated to user entities through our website, contract agreement, or in a service level agreement. <a href=\"https://middleware.io/security/\">Read more about our security policies here.</a></p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-card\"><div class=\"accordion-header\"><div class=\"accordion-toggle \"><h5 class=\"accordion-title\">Can I cancel my account?</h5><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 7V15M7 11H15M21 11C21 16.5228 16.5228 21 11 21C5.47715 21 1 16.5228 1 11C1 5.47715 5.47715 1 11 1C16.5228 1 21 5.47715 21 11Z\" stroke=\"#5B5FC7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"faq-collapse \"><div class=\"accordion-body\"><p>Yes, you can cancel anytime with the pay-as-you-go option. We keep your data for 30 days from the cancellation date so you can download them.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"accordion-card\"><div class=\"accordion-header\"><div class=\"accordion-toggle \"><h5 class=\"accordion-title\">How much does OpsAI cost?</h5><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 7V15M7 11H15M21 11C21 16.5228 16.5228 21 11 21C5.47715 21 1 16.5228 1 11C1 5.47715 5.47715 1 11 1C16.5228 1 21 5.47715 21 11Z\" stroke=\"#5B5FC7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"faq-collapse \"><div class=\"accordion-body\"><p>Error detection is completely free so that you can view all detected issues at no extra cost. To find the root cause or get solution it's just $1 per error. PR generation is included along with root cause analysis and solution at no extra cost.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"call-to-action-sm\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"d-flex\"><h2>Optimize More, Worry Less With Middleware</h2><div class=\"buttons\"><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"ahref-btn primary\" href=\"https://app.middleware.io/auth/register/\">Get Started</a><a class=\"ahref-btn secondary\" href=\"/demo-request/\">Book a Demo</a></div></div></div></section></div></div></main><footer><div class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-links\"><div class=\"link-wrapper\"><h5>Product</h5><ul><li><a target=\"\" href=\"/product/infrastructure-monitoring/\">Infrastructure Monitoring</a></li><li><a target=\"\" href=\"/product/log-monitoring/\">Log Monitoring</a></li><li><a target=\"\" href=\"/product/apm/\">APM</a></li><li><a target=\"\" href=\"/product/metrics/\">Metrics</a></li><li><a target=\"\" href=\"/product/distributed-tracing/\">Distributed Tracing</a></li><li><a target=\"\" href=\"/product/database-monitoring/\">Database Monitoring</a></li><li><a target=\"\" href=\"/product/real-user-monitoring/\">Real User Monitoring</a></li><li><a target=\"\" href=\"/product/synthet